{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Pipes are leaking, players are screaming, and your brain is racing. Welcome to It\u2019s My Water \u2014 \u201cA fast-paced multiplayer pipe puzzle game where friendship goes down the drain\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>\ud83d\udd27 Build the Flow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate, place, and link pipes in frantic real-time matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 Outplay Your Rivals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block paths, drop hazards, and flip the game in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face up to [X] players online. Fast rounds. Endless rematches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Play Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in casual mode or climb the competitive ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Keep It Fresh</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events and shifting boards mean no two matches are the same.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944450?t=1756536900","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944450?t=1756536900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944450/2fa918928622c074a846e61d379d0afa39ac4d99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756536900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944450/2fa918928622c074a846e61d379d0afa39ac4d99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756536900","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descript